# Kamen_Fight game development timeline

18/8/26: Kick-start, create portrait photos, player selection screen; follow yu yu hakusho Super Nintendo game style. 
About menu: Can choose CPU/Player, 1-player game only, no difficulty.
Riders: Include all showga riders + shadow moon.
19/8/26: Add game transaction screens after selected riders to the matchup screen. Added button indicators on what are pressed.
